0 AD)"},{"url":"https://data.dong-chinese.com/img/sinica/%F0%A1%B9%BD_10.png","source":"academia-sinica","description":"說文‧羊部","type":"Seal","era":"Shuowen (~100 AD)"}],"shuowen":"《說文》：“羌，西戎牧羊人也。从人，从羊，羊亦聲。南方蠻閩从虫，北方狄从犬，東方貉从豸，西方羌从羊，此六種也。西南人、僬僥从人，蓋在坤地，頗有順理之性。唯東夷从大，大，人也。夷俗仁，仁者壽，有君子不死之國。孔子曰：‘道不行，欲之九夷，乘桴浮於海，有以也。’，古文羌如此。”","variants":[{"char":"羌","parts":"𦍌儿","source":"academia-sinica"}]},{"_id":"5f523b00de54193ed8737359","char":"𡸣","codepoint":"U+21E23","strokeCount":11,"sources":["unicode"]},{"_id":"5f523b00de54193ed873735a","char":"𡸤","codepoint":"U+21E24","strokeCount":11,"sources":["academia-sinica","unicode"],"images":[{"url":"https://data.dong-chinese.com/img/sinica/%F0%A1%B8%A4_0.png","source":"academia-sinica","description":"說文‧山部","type":"Seal","era":"Shuowen (~100 AD)"}],"shuowen":"《說文》：“，山也。从，戕聲。”","variants":[{"char":"𡸤","parts":"山戕","source":"academia-sinica"}]},{"_id":"5f523b00de54193ed8737366","char":"𡸰","codepoint":"U+21E30","strokeCount":11,"sources":["unicode"]},{"_id":"5f523b00de54193ed873737c","char":"𡹆","codepoint":"U+21E46","strokeCount":11,"sources":["unicode"]},{"_id":"5f523b00de54193ed87373a1","char":"𡹫","codepoint":"U+21E6B","strokeCount":12,"sources":["unicode"]},{"_id":"5f523b00de54193ed87373a9","char":"𡹳","codepoint":"U+21E73","strokeCount":12,"sources":["unicode"]},{"_id":"5f523b00de54193ed873733a","char":"𡸄","codepoint":"U+21E04","strokeCount":10,"sources":["unicode"]},{"_id":"5f523b00de54193ed873733c","char":"𡸆","codepoint":"U+21E06","strokeCount":10,"sources":["unicode"]},{"_id":"5f523b00de54193ed873733f","char":"𡸉","codepoint":"U+21E09","strokeCount":10,"sources":["unicode"]},{"_id":"5f523b00de54193ed8737343","char":"𡸍","codepoint":"U+21E0D","strokeCount":10,"sources":["unicode"]},{"_id":"5f523b00de54193ed873734a","char":"𡸔","codepoint":"U+21E14","strokeCount":11,"sources":["unicode"]},{"_id":"5f523b00de54193ed8737351","char":"𡸛","codepoint":"U+21E1B","strokeCount":11,"sources":["unicode"]},{"_id":"5f523b00de54193ed8737357","char":"𡸡","co